message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "custody-watch"
abstract: >-
  Ranking of luggage custody changes in airport surveillance video for human
  review; not a theft detector. It tracks which bags belong to which travelling
  group, and uses no facial recognition, identity database or biometric
  storage.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Marcus
    family-names: Vinicius
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcus-vreis/custody-watch"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.0.1
keywords:
  - computer-vision
  - surveillance
  - object-tracking
  - airport-security
